---
import Prose from "../Prose.astro";
import Footnote from "../Footnote.astro";
import Anchor from "../Anchor.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <h2 class="eyebrow">About Me</h2>

  <Prose>
    <p>I'm a software developer in London, working mostly on the web.</p>

    <p>
      Outside work I build and maintain open-source tools, mostly npm packages and command-line
      utilities. This site is where I write about that, and whatever else seems worth sharing.
    </p>

    <h3>Experience</h3>

    <p>
      By day I'm a Senior Software Developer at <Anchor
        href="https://trayport.com"
        text="Trayport"
      /> in London, across their React frontends and C# backends.
    </p>

    <p>
      Before that I built web-based mobile apps in the commerce sector with Java Spring and Angular.
      My degree was in games development, so there's some Unity and OpenGL back there too.
    </p>

    <Footnote>
      All opinions and views expressed on this site are my own and do not represent those of my
      employers.
    </Footnote>

    <h3>My Code</h3>

    <p>
      Lots of what I build outside of work is public on my GitHub profile, <Anchor
        href="https://github.com/tobysmith568"
        text="tobysmith568"
      />. Feel free to look around.
    </p>

    <p>
      Anything I build with other people usually gets its own GitHub organisation, all linked from
      my profile.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</section>
